SetPool_PoolRegistry_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when caller not owner
│  └── it should revert
└── when caller owner
   ├── when vault zero
   │  └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
   ├── when adapter zero and not idle only
   │  └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
   ├── when offchain id empty
   │  └── it should revert with EmptyOffchainId
   ├── when status none
   │  └── it should revert with InvalidStatus
   ├── when venue kind zero
   │  └── it should revert with InvalidVenueKind
   ├── when chain id zero
   │  └── it should revert with InvalidChainId
   ├── when risk score exceeds max
   │  └── it should revert with InvalidRiskScore
   ├── when elasticity exceeds max
   │  └── it should revert with InvalidElasticity
   ├── when entry slippage exceeds max
   │  └── it should revert with InvalidEntrySlippage
   ├── when exit cost exceeds max
   │  └── it should revert with InvalidExitCost
   └── when config valid
      ├── given pool new
      │  ├── given status active
      │  │  ├── it should store the config
      │  │  ├── it should add the pool to the roster
      │  │  ├── it should increment the active pool count
      │  │  ├── it should increment the epoch
      │  │  └── it should emit PoolSet
      │  ├── given status active and idle only
      │  │  ├── it should allow a zero adapter
      │  │  ├── it should add the pool to the roster
      │  │  └── it should not change the active pool count
      │  └── given status exit only
      │     ├── it should add the pool to the roster
      │     ├── it should not change the active pool count
      │     └── it should emit PoolSet
      └── given pool existing
         ├── given status changes active to exit only
         │  ├── it should decrement the active pool count
         │  └── it should keep the pool in the roster
         ├── given status changes exit only to active
         │  └── it should increment the active pool count
         ├── given pool becomes idle only
         │  └── it should decrement the active pool count
         └── given status stays active
            ├── it should not change the active pool count
            └── it should update the config
